OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 29 NOV
OL,4,G1600FSound Of Cinema
OL,5,     GYour weekly celebration of movie
OL,6,     Gsoundtracks hosted by Edith
OL,7,     GBowman. This week she speaks to
OL,8,     Gfilm composer Alan Silvestri, and
OL,9,     GJamie Cullum presents his Pick of
OL,10,     Gthe Flicks.
OL,11,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,12,     GJess Gillam meets clarinettist
OL,13,     GMartin Frost to swap some of
OL,14,     Gtheir favourite music including
OL,15,     GSchubert, Vivaldi, Wynton
OL,16,     GMarsalis and Dusty Springfield.
OL,17,G1800FOpera on 3: Janacek's The
OL,18,     FMakropulos Case
OL,19,     GAusrine Stundyte sings the title
OL,20,     Grole in a new production from the
OL,21,     GRoyal Opera House, conducted by
OL,22,     GJakub Hrusa.
