OL,4,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,5,     GTom Service with recorded
OL,6,     Ghighlights from this year's
OL,7,     Gfestival including the Estonian
OL,8,     GElectronic Music Society Ensemble
OL,9,     Gand the UK premiere of Sarah
OL,10,     GHennies' Borrowed Light.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GThe Asturian pianist makes his
OL,13,     Gdebut in the modernist hall at
OL,14,     Gthe Palau de la Musica Catalana,
OL,15,     GBarcelona. He plays Chopin and
OL,16,     GMompou, as well as works by
OL,17,     GAlbeniz.
